IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPECKV-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TREE-DEPTH          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BRANCH-FACTOR       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PREFETCHED-NODES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 HIT-RATE-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPECKV-V2.
    IF TREE-DEPTH == 0 OR BRANCH-FACTOR == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE TREE-DEPTH TO PREFETCHED-NODES.
    MULTIPLY BRANCH-FACTOR BY PREFETCHED-NODES.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY PREFETCHED-NODES.
    MOVE 95 TO HIT-RATE-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PREFETCHED-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 HIT-RATE-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
